1693:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Disables the interrupt events related to transmit FIFO. \n\n
1694:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * By disabling the interrupt events, generation of interrupt is stopped. User can poll the event
