1782:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * 				   \b Range: @ref XMC_USIC0_CH0, @ref XMC_USIC0_CH1 to @ref XMC_USIC2_CH1 based on device su
1783:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @param data Data to be transmitted.
1784:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @param frame_length Frame length to be configured while transmitting the data. \n
1785:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * 			\b Range: minimum= 0, maximum= 31. e.g: For a frame length of 16, set \a frame_length as 15.
1786:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @return None
1787:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
1788:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * \par<b>Description</b><br>
1789:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Writes data to the transmit FIFO in frame length control mode. \n\n
1790:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * When frame length control is enabled for dynamic update of frame length, this API can be used.
1791:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * \a frame_length represents the frame length to be updated by the peripheral.
1792:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * \a frame_length is used as index for the IN[] register array.
1793:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
