1935:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Clears the transmit FIFO event flags in the status register. \n\n
1936:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * USIC channel peripheral does not clear the event flags after they are read.
1937:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * This API clears the events provided in the \a mask value.
1938:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * XMC_USIC_CH_TXFIFO_EVENT enumeration can be used as input. Multiple events
1939:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * can be cleared by providing a mask value obtained by bitwise OR operation of
1940:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * multiple event enumerations.
