 412:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * Enable SPI channel by calling XMC_USIC_CH_Enable() and then configures
 413:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * <ul>
 414:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * <li>Baudrate,</li>
 415:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * <li>Passive data level as active high,</li>
 416:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * <li>Shift control signal as active high,</li>
 417:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * <li>Frame length as 64U,</li>
 418:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * <li>Word length as 8U,</li>
 419:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * <li>Enable Hardware port control mode,</li>
 420:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * <li>Enable transmission of data TDV(Transmit data valid) bit is set to 1,</li>
 421:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * <li>Enable invalidation of data in TBUF once loaded into shift register,</li>
 422:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * <li>Parity mode settings</li>
 423:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * </ul>
 424:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * And if master mode is selected,
 425:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * <ul>
 426:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * <li>Enables MSLS signal generation,</li>
 427:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * <li>configures slave selection as normal mode,</li>
 428:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * <li>Set polarity for the Slave signal,</li>
 429:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * <li>Enable Frame end mode(MSLS signal is kept active after transmission of a frame)</li>
 430:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * </ul>
 431:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  */
