 840:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * \par<b>Description:</b><br>
 841:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * Configures the inter word delay by setting PCR.PCTQ1, PCR.DCTQ1 bit fields.\n\n
 842:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * The inter word delay is dependent on the peripheral clock. The maximum possible value is calcula
 843:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * below formula\n
 844:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  *            Maximum inter word delay = ((1 + PCTQ1_max)(1 + DCTQ1_max)) / peripheral clock\n
 845:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  *                                       where PCTQ1_max = 3 and DCTQ1_max = 31\n
 846:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * After configuring the inter word delay, this has to be enabled by invoking XMC_SPI_CH_EnableInte
 847:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  *
