 863:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4200/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * After configuring the inter word delay, this has to be enabled by invoking XMC_SPI_CH_EnableInte
